q 0.04 0.16 0.32 rg 0 808 595 34 re f Q
BT /F2 8 Tf 1 1 1 rg 1 0 0 1 42 820 Tm (SAHAYAK | SIMPLE LANGUAGE GUIDE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 780.00 Tm (Some translation or speech services need internet, so we should not say the whole project works) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 767.90 Tm (    fully offline.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 745.80 Tm (Slide 11 - Data, training and fair testing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 728.80 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 715.70 Tm (To add a new sign, we need correctly labelled examples. We check those examples, train a trial) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 703.60 Tm (    model, and test it on fresh examples that were not used for training. We should also check) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 691.50 Tm (    that the old signs still work. When possible, test using different people or different) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 679.40 Tm (    recording sessions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 662.30 Tm (A response can be fast but wrong. We should only give an accuracy percentage when we have a saved) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 650.20 Tm (    test report. Useful results include how often each sign was correct and which signs were) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 638.10 Tm (    confused.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 616.00 Tm (Simple technical notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 599.00 Tm (- Static model: 126 values for a two-hand pose.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 585.90 Tm (- Continuous model: 132 values per frame and 10 time steps, making 1,320 values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 572.80 Tm (- Frontend: HTML, CSS and JavaScript in the browser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 559.70 Tm (- Hand points: MediaPipe Hands in the browser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 546.60 Tm (- Backend: Python with Flask.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 533.50 Tm (- Model: scikit-learn-compatible classifier saved with Joblib.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 520.40 Tm (- Hosting: Vercel for the frontend, Render for the backend.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 498.30 Tm (Questions judges may ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 481.30 Tm (Q: Why use landmarks instead of a full image?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 468.20 Tm (A: Landmarks give a smaller set of numbers that describe hand shape and position. They can still) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 456.10 Tm (    miss other information that matters to sign language.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 439.00 Tm (Q: Does adding a label automatically teach the model?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 425.90 Tm (A: No. We need labelled examples, training, fair testing and deployment of an updated model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 408.80 Tm (Q: Where does recognition happen?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 395.70 Tm (A: The browser finds and draws hand points. The trained model makes the prediction in the backend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 378.60 Tm (Q: What is confidence?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 365.50 Tm (A: A score showing how strongly the model favours one label. It is not a guarantee that the result) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 353.40 Tm (    is correct.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 336.30 Tm (Q: How do we know the model is accurate?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 323.20 Tm (A: We need a proper test using fresh examples and results for each label. We should not guess a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 311.10 Tm (    percentage.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 289.00 Tm (Handover to Himanxhu) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 272.00 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 258.90 Tm (That is the path from the camera to the model prediction. My teammate Himanxhu V Ghimire will now) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 246.80 Tm (    demonstrate the website, explain how to test it and discuss what we still need to improve.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 224.70 Tm (Speaker checklist) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 207.70 Tm (- Remember the workflow in order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 194.60 Tm (- Do not mix up the static model and the sequence model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 181.50 Tm (- Explain what 126, 132 and 1,320 mean.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 168.40 Tm (- Use the active backend label list, not an old list from memory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 155.30 Tm (- Do not claim unmeasured accuracy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 142.20 Tm (- If a live request fails, explain the intended workflow honestly instead of pretending it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 130.10 Tm (      worked.) Tj ET
